# Chapter Deployment Checklist

> Last updated: 2026-07-19 · Workflow: chapter-editor → chapter-source-import → chapter-final-check → book-deploy

---

## Quick Reference

| Step | What | Command / Action |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Format Drive drafts | Strip YAML, add metadata, page breaks, section GIFs |
| 2 | Archive repo files | Copy to `.archive/YYYY-MM-DD/` |
| 3 | Import to repo | Copy Drive drafts → repo stable names |
| 4 | Update index.md | Title, description, learning objectives, roadmap |
| 5 | Generate | `npm run generate` from `reader-hybrid-v1.1/` |
| 6 | Preview locally | `localhost:3001` (dev) or `localhost:3000` (preview) |
| 7 | Lint | `npm run lint` (tsc --noEmit) |
| 8 | Build | `npm run build` |
| 9 | Commit & push | Stage chapter files + `bookData.ts`, commit, push |
| 10 | Deploy | `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes --scope dima-media` |

---

## Detailed Steps

### 1. Format Drive Drafts for Publication

- Strip YAML frontmatter (`---` blocks) — repo uses `<!-- metadata: date="YYYY-MM-DD" -->` on line 1
- Add `<!-- PAGE BREAK -->` + `<div style="page-break-after: always;"></div>` before every major section
- Add section-opening GIFs to companion files:
  - Let's Build: `ch00-let-build-resize`
  - RAT: `RAT_nqr5a3`
  - Lab: `lab_jpifze`
- Do NOT edit the Drive source file — only edit the repo copy

### 2. Archive Current Repo Files

Copy all chapter and lab files to `.archive/YYYY-MM-DD/` before overwriting.

### 3. Import Drive Drafts into Repo

Drive → Repo mapping (stable filenames, no dates in repo):

| Drive | Repo |
|---|---|
| `main/chNN-main-YYYY-MM-DD.md` | `core-concepts.md` |
| `lets-build/chNN-lets-build-YYYY-MM-DD.md` | `lets-build.md` |
| `rat/chNN-rat-YYYY-MM-DD.md` | `rat.md` |
| `lab/chNN-lab-YYYY-MM-DD.md` | `labs/lab-NN/index.md` |
| `lab/chNN-lab-answer-key-YYYY-MM-DD.md` | `labs/lab-NN/instructor/` |

### 4. Update index.md

The Introduction page renders from `index.md`. Update:
- Chapter title and subtitle
- Full multi-paragraph description
- `## Chapter Video` section (or placeholder)
- `## Learning Objectives` (numbered list)
- `## Chapter Roadmap` — **use list format, NOT a table** (generator strips tables from intro pages)

### 5. Generate Book Data

```bash
cd books/database-book/platform-pilots/reader-hybrid-v1.1
npm run generate
```

Verify: 0 warnings, correct chapter/page counts.

### 6. Preview Locally

- **Dev**: `localhost:3001` — hot-reloads, `npm run dev`
- **Production preview**: `localhost:3000` — static snapshot, `npm run build && vite preview`
- Check: intro page, core concepts, companions, lab — GIFs, page breaks, no exposed answers

### 7. Lint

```bash
npm run lint   # tsc --noEmit — must pass
```

### 8. Build

```bash
npm run build  # validate + generate + vite build
```

### 9. Commit & Push

From repo root:

```bash
git add books/database-book/files/source/chapters/chNN-*/
git add books/database-book/files/source/labs/lab-NN-*/
git add books/database-book/platform-pilots/reader-hybrid-v1.1/src/generated/bookData.ts
git commit -m "Update reader content: chNN main, lets-build, rat, lab"
git push
```

Only stage chapter, lab, and generated files. Leave unrelated working-tree changes unstaged.

### 10. Deploy to Vercel

```bash
cd dima-publishing repo root
npx vercel deploy --prod --yes --scope dima-media
```

Production: **https://www.dimapublishing.com**

---

## Common Pitfalls

| Issue | Fix |
|---|---|
| Index shows old content | `index.md` wasn't updated — separate file from `core-concepts.md` |
| Roadmap missing from intro | Generator strips tables — use list format instead |
| Preview shows stale content | Kill and restart `vite preview` server |
| YAML frontmatter visible | Strip `---` blocks, use `<!-- metadata: date="..." -->` |
| Lab answers visible | Answer keys go in `instructor/` only |
| Push rejected (non-fast-forward) | `git stash && git pull --no-rebase && git stash pop && git push` |

---

## File Map

```
dima-publishing/
├── books/database-book/
│   ├── files/source/
│   │   ├── chapters/chNN-slug/     ← index.md, core-concepts.md, lets-build.md, etc.
│   │   └── labs/lab-NN-slug/       ← index.md, instructor/
│   └── platform-pilots/reader-hybrid-v1.1/
│       ├── scripts/generateBookData.ts   ← content generator
│       └── src/generated/bookData.ts     ← generated (committed)
└── vercel.json                      ← root Vercel config (data-pilot project)
